{"latest_judgment":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_49_278218781#1_564830232","relevance":3,"reason":"The passage directly explains Dame Van Winkle's negative portrayal: she is described in unflattering terms such as “shrew,” “virago,” and “termagant” because she lectures Rip about failing to work the farm and provide for the family; it also notes she is one-dimensional, voiceless, and functions as a symbol of oppression rather than a rounded character.","learned":"Owl Eyes explicitly ties her negative labels to Rip's failure to work/provide and to Irving's one-dimensional, voiceless construction of her as a symbolic oppressor."},"action":{"op":"next","qid":"q3622","reason":"This virago/idleness query is producing strong direct evidence from literary annotation sources, so continue to find any additional unjudged passages using the same framing."}}
{"request":{"op":"next","qid":"q3622"},"response":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_39_795508142#15_1606541909","ok":true,"op":"next","qid":"q3622","rank":3,"snippet":"\": 6922.000000 , \"headings\": \"Rip Van Winkle Characters Rip Van Winkle Characters Characters Download Rip Van Winkle Study Guide Rip Van Winkle Dame Van Winkle Judith Cardenier Rip Van Winkle, Jr. The Stranger Hendrick (Henry) Hudson Nicholas Vedder Derrick Van Bummel Brom Dutcher Peter Vanderdonk The Self-Important Man Unlock This Study Guide Now \" , \"segment\": \"Dame Van Winkle is also called a “virago,” which is a domineering woman. However, the term “<cover>virago” may also refer to a warrior woman. This highlights how Dame Van Winkle fights throughout the story against her husband. She does so to help herself and her family. </cover>Dame Van Winkle is so domineering that even Rip’s dog, Wolf, is afraid of her. Despite all of Dame Van Winkle’s efforts, her husband still does not help her. He instead goes hunting and disappears for twenty years. She passes away before he returns. Rip is relieved by her death, happy to be free from her. Dame Van Winkle is characterized throughout the story by industrial descriptions.\" , \"start_char\": 6269.000000 , \"title\":"}}
