{"latest_judgment":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_06_877027687#10_1483985859","relevance":2,"reason":"The GradeSaver passage is related and provides partial support: Rip is happier after Dame Van Winkle’s death because his idleness becomes socially acceptable in old age. It implies she was portrayed negatively because she opposed his idleness, but it does not directly focus on why she is portrayed so harshly.","learned":"GradeSaver suggests Dame Van Winkle's negative role is tied to Rip's desire for idleness; once she is gone and he is old, the same idleness becomes socially acceptable."},"action":{"op":"next","qid":"q3638","reason":"The query is targeting established study-guide sources and has produced at least related GradeSaver evidence, so the next result may contain a more direct explanation of Dame Van Winkle's negative portrayal."}}
{"request":{"op":"next","qid":"q3638"},"response":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_06_877027687#0_1483969041","ok":true,"op":"next","qid":"q3638","rank":4,"snippet":"kind and gentle neighbor. His single flaw is an utter inability to do any work that could turn a profit. It is not because he is <cover>lazy—in fact, he is perfectly willing to spend all day helping someone else with their labor. He is just incapable of doing anything to help his own household. He also is well-known for being an obedient, henpecked husband, for Dame Van Winkle has no problem shouting insults into the neighborhood and tracking him down in the village to berate him. All the women and children in the village love him and side with him against his wife, and even the dogs do not bark at him. Indeed, when he tries to console himself and escape from Dame Van Winkle, he often goes to a sort of philosophical or political club that meets on a bench outside of a small inn.\" , \"start_char\": 0.000000 , \"title\": \"Rip Van Winkle and Other Stories “Rip Van Winkle” Summary and Analysis | GradeSaver</cover>\" , \"url\": \"http://www.gradesaver.com/rip-van-winkle/study-guide/summary-rip-van-winkle\" }","skipped":[{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_06_877027687#1_1483972262","rank":2,"relevance":3},{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_45_1089796809#0_2157680530","rank":3,"relevance":3}]}}
